    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d109-a1">

                <pb facs="0205" n="859" sameAs="frus:frus1875v02/pg859"/>

                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Inclosure 1 in No. 237.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegrams to and from the consul at
                        Acapulco.]</seg></opener>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Sutter to Mr. Foster.</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Legation United States of America</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >Acapulco</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1875-01-27"><hi rendition="#italic">January</hi>
                        27</date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p rendition="#center">[Received in Mexico 27th, 11 a.m.]</p>
                <p>Last night the Evangelical church was attacked. Five killed, one American among
                    them; eleven wounded. Mr. Hutchinson escaped and is in safety.</p>
                <closer><signed>J. A. SUTTER, <hi rendition="#italic">Consul.</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
